text:
This game just hates you;
Wanted to be a hero?
Hope you're happy now.

After quite a lot of time i have found out that storage is a problem to me! there just need to be so many 'Storage compactors' so i could fit all my items! please help!
And please implement another speed level, i sometimes fell like i need it really much ;-;
Also, a multiplayer Co-op gamemode would be neat!

The game play isn't amazing, but it is more than good enough to get by. Same goes for the graphics.(Although, at the time this was released the graphics probably would have seemed amazing.)
Overall, one of the better games I have played. The story has tense moments that are almost exclusive to this game, there is no guarantee that the main characters will survive(soft-almost-not-even-a-spoiler spoiler:
), and it does provide somewhat of a challenge at certain parts even for gamers who have played shooters extensively.
